cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its published results, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "NSE Alpha Lab"
abstract: >-
  A research and backtesting lab for NSE momentum-rotation strategies,
  including point-in-time index membership, split/bonus-adjusted prices, a charge-aware
  momentum rotation engine, a 968-configuration sensitivity sweep and benchmark-relative
  alpha statistics. Research preview: results are price-vs-price, the headline alpha is
  not statistically significant, and no multiple-testing correction is applied.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-20"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - momentum
  - backtesting
  - quantitative finance
  - national stock exchange of india
  - nse
  - nifty 500
  - equity research
  - research software
